NSE Nmap Scripting Engine
NSE is a powerful feature of the nmap tool or utility and essentially allows users to
write and share scripts to automate(自动化) a wide variety of tasks. Nmap has a huge library of
already created scripts by community, nmap is open source.

Nmap's library PATH: /usr/share/nmap/scripts/
Extension: .nse
ls -la /usr/share/nmap/scripts/ | grep http
ls -la /usr/share/nmap/scripts/ | grep -e "http"

passive gath scripts, usefull for http enumeration: http-enum.nse

nmap -sC <TARGET>// or use "nmap --script=default <TARGET>"

NMAP Scripts Categories
default(常规默认检测), safe(通常不具备破坏性的检测),
discovery(主机及服务信息发现), version(辅助服务版本识别),
auth(身份验证相关检测), vuln(漏洞检测), 
brute(密码猜测), intrusive(入侵), exploit(漏洞利用相关脚本)

Before using each scripts from nmap, is necessary to check its category and know the risk that it will be provided. 
nmap --script-help="mongodb-databases" //Terminal Output: Categories: default, discovery, safe

nmap -A //Aggresive Scan(激进扫描，侵略扫描). Enables OS detection, version detection, script scanning, and traceroute.
